  <diagram id="wxBBYEOZunbaS4Ke48gR" name="Page-2">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1006" dy="691" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User as Subject (e.g., Alice)\n    participant PEP as PEP: Policy Enforcement Point&lt;br&gt;(e.g., API Gateway)\n    participant PDP as PDP: Policy Decision Point&lt;br&gt;(e.g., OPA / AuthZ Service)\n    participant PAP as PAP: Policy Administration Point&lt;br&gt;(e.g., GitOps / Admin UI)\n    participant PIP as PIP: Policy Information Point&lt;br&gt;(e.g., LDAP / Database)\n    Note over User,PEP: The request is paused at the gatekeeper.\n    User-&gt;&gt;PEP: Request Access (e.g., GET /document/123)\n    \n    Note over PEP,PDP: The PDP does not know the rules.&lt;br&gt;It asks for a decision.\n    PEP-&gt;&gt;PDP: Access Request Context&lt;br&gt;(Subject: Alice, Action: Read, Resource: doc/123)\n    \n    par [Retrieve Necessary Context]\n        Note over PDP,PAP: Retrieve rules&lt;br&gt;defined by admins.\n        PDP-&gt;&gt;PAP: Query Rules&lt;br&gt;(e.g., What are doc/123 policies?)\n        PAP--&gt;&gt;PDP: Response: Specific Policies&lt;br&gt;(e.g., \&quot;Must be from Dept X\&quot;)\n    and\n        Note over PDP,PIP: Retrieve missing&lt;br&gt;contextual data.\n        PDP-&gt;&gt;PIP: Query Context&lt;br&gt;(e.g., What is Alice&#39;s department?)\n        PIP--&gt;&gt;PDP: Response: Context Attributes&lt;br&gt;(e.g., Alice Dept = &#39;Finance&#39;)\n    end\n    \n    Note over PDP: Logic Evaluation Point:&lt;br&gt;Evaluates rules (PAP) + context (PIP)&lt;br&gt;to form the decision.\n    \n    PDP--&gt;&gt;PEP: Access Decision (e.g., PERMIT / DENY)\n    \n    Note over PEP: PEP physically enforces the&lt;br&gt;decision from the brain.\n    PEP--&gt;&gt;User: Enforcement Action&lt;br&gt;(Allow / Block [e.g., 403])&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="0n2rByeTOEA-iS5bZh_D-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="Subject (e.g., Alice)" mermaidId="n:User" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;elbowEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;elbow&quot;:&quot;vertical&quot;,&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};lifelineDashed=0;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=6;lifelineColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);participant=seqActorStick;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;spacingBottom=4;size=90;lifelineMirror=1;fillColor=light-dark(#ECECFF,#1f2020);strokeColor=light-dark(#9370DB,#cccccc);fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" mermaidBaseValue="Subject (e.g., Alice)" id="0n2rByeTOEA-iS5bZh_D-2">
