  <diagram id="01HZcRmIn5vjBQfopJo_" name="Page-3">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1006" dy="691" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor User as Actor (User / External)\n    participant APIGW as APIGW / A2AGW\n    participant AS as IDP + AuthServer\n    \n    box AppAlpha (Trust Boundary Alpha)\n        participant AIApp as AIApp\n        participant A1 as Agent 1\n        participant A2 as Agent 2\n        participant MCP1 as MCP Server (Alpha)\n        participant A3 as Agent 3\n    end\n\n    participant LLMGW as LLMGW\n    participant A2AGW as A2AGW (Cross-Boundary)\n    participant MCPGW as MCPGW (Cross-Boundary)\n\n    box AppBeta (Trust Boundary Beta)\n        participant A11 as Agent 11\n        participant A21 as Agent 21\n        participant MCP2 as MCP Server (Beta)\n        participant A31 as Agent 31\n        participant Res2 as Backend Resources\n    end\n\n    participant SaaS as External SaaS\n\n    %% 1. Ingress &amp; Auth\n    rect rgb(240, 244, 248)\n        note over User, AIApp: 1. Ingress &amp; Perimeter Entry\n        User-&gt;&gt;AS: Authenticate (OAuth 2.0 / PKCE)\n        AS--&gt;&gt;User: Return T1 Access Token\n        User-&gt;&gt;APIGW: Ingress Call (UI or Direct Agent Call) + T1\n        APIGW-&gt;&gt;AIApp: Forward Request + T1 (or directly to Agent 1)\n    end\n\n    %% 2. Intra-App Flow (AppAlpha)\n    rect rgb(238, 247, 238)\n        note over AIApp, MCP1: 2. AppAlpha Intra-App Execution (Direct Local AuthZ - No Gateway)\n        AIApp-&gt;&gt;A1: Invoke Agent1 + T1 (Local AuthZ check via AgentCard)\n        A1-&gt;&gt;A2: Delegate Task to Agent2 + T1\n        A2-&gt;&gt;MCP1: Invoke Tool / Resource + T1\n        note over MCP1: Local AuthZ: Validates fine-grained mcp-scopes in T1\n        MCP1--&gt;&gt;A2: Tool Result / Backend Resource Data\n    end\n\n    %% 3. LLM Gateway Invocations\n    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)\n        note over A2, LLMGW: 3. Model Request Execution\n        A2-&gt;&gt;AS: RFC 8693 Exchange (Subject_Token=T1, Target=LLMGW)\n        AS--&gt;&gt;A2: Return T_LLM (sub=User, act=Agent2)\n        A2-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Inference Request + T_LLM\n        LLMGW--&gt;&gt;A2: Model Completion Response\n    end\n\n    %% 4. Cross-App Agent Calling (Alpha -&gt; Beta via A2AGW)\n    rect rgb(254, 243, 235)\n        note over A3, A11: 4. Cross-Boundary Agent Delegation (AppAlpha -&gt; AppBeta)\n        A3-&gt;&gt;AS: Token Exchange (Subject_Token=T1, Target=Agent11, Skill=data_analysis)\n        AS--&gt;&gt;A3: Return T_A2A_X (Contains act_chn, skill_id, AgentCard URI)\n        A3-&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Call Agent11 + T_A2A_X\n        A2AGW-&gt;&gt;A2AGW: Verify Agent11 AgentCard &amp; Policy\n        A2AGW-&gt;&gt;A11: Forward Delegated Request + T_A2A_X\n    end\n\n    %% 5. Cross-App MCP Calling (Alpha -&gt; Beta via MCPGW)\n    rect rgb(253, 238, 244)\n        note over A1, MCP2: 5. Cross-Boundary Tool Call (Agent1 -&gt; Beta MCP Server)\n        A1-&gt;&gt;AS: Token Exchange (Subject_Token=T1, Target=MCP2, Scopes=[mcp:db:read])\n        AS--&gt;&gt;A1: Return T_MCP_X\n        A1-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Call MCP Server (Beta) + T_MCP_X\n        MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Validate mcp-scopes &amp; Target Schema Policy\n        MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCP2: Exec Tool Request + T_MCP_X\n        MCP2-&gt;&gt;Res2: Query Backend Resources\n        Res2--&gt;&gt;MCP2: Data Payload\n        MCP2--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Exec Result\n        MCPGW--&gt;&gt;A1: Filtered Response\n    end\n\n    %% 6. AppBeta Internal &amp; Outbound SaaS\n    rect rgb(240, 240, 250)\n        note over A11, SaaS: 6. AppBeta Execution &amp; Outbound SaaS Call\n        A11-&gt;&gt;A21: Direct Local Call + T_A2A_X (Local AuthZ)\n        A21-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Model Call via T_LLM\n        LLMGW--&gt;&gt;A21: Model Response\n        A11-&gt;&gt;A31: Trigger SaaS Workflow\n        A31-&gt;&gt;SaaS: Outbound API Call + T_SaaS\n        SaaS--&gt;&gt;A31: External API Result\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="HMMs99ku7m5Hrp3Cc8yY-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
