        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant Caller as Caller (App or Agent)\n    participant GW as Gateway (A2A/LLM/MCP)\n    participant eAOR as eAOR (Policy/Registry)\n    participant SSO as fmSSO (iDP)\n    participant Target as Target (Agent/Model/Tool)\n\n    Caller-&gt;&gt;GW: API Request + JWT (Broad Context)\n    GW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Evaluate Policy (Is Caller allowed to reach Target?)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;GW: Permit + Required Scopes for Target\n    \n    Note over GW,SSO: Token Exchange (RFC 8693)\n    GW-&gt;&gt;SSO: POST /token&lt;br/&gt;grant_type=token-exchange&lt;br/&gt;subject_token=[Incoming JWT]&lt;br/&gt;audience=[Target ID]&lt;br/&gt;scope=[Restricted Scopes]\n    \n    SSO--&gt;&gt;GW: Return Down-scoped JWT\n    \n    GW-&gt;&gt;Target: Forward Request + Down-scoped JWT\n    Note over Target: Target receives a token valid ONLY&lt;br/&gt;for itself, with minimal permissions.&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="RXoJRAUZrqwV4y_K7ziE-1">
