  <diagram id="IqG9ekuAsQUyCodJEhBh" name="ExecAgent">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2490" dy="1382" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor U as User\n    participant SSO as fmSSO (iDP)\n    participant APP as ai-app (Orchestrator)\n    participant A2A as A2AGW\n    participant AGT as Agent\n    participant LLMGW as LLMGW\n    participant LLM as Backend LLM\n    participant MCPGW as MCPGW\n    participant MCP as MCP-Server-Tools\n    participant eAOR as eAIR (Registry/Policy)\n    participant RES as Backend Resource\n    \n    %% Authentication &amp; Edge Interaction\n    U-&gt;&gt;SSO: Authenticate\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;U: Return OpaqueToken\n    U-&gt;&gt;APP: Submit Prompt + OpaqueToken\n    \n    %% Token Exchange &amp; Orchestration Setup\n    APP-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange (OpaqueToken -&gt; JWT)\n    Note over APP,SSO: JWT binds User Identity,&lt;br/&gt;APP Workload Identity.\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;APP: Return JWT\n    APP-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Fetch Agent routing &amp; Orchaestration Policy\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;APP: Return Agent metadata/permissions\n    \n    %% Agent Invocation\n    APP-&gt;&gt;A2A: Invoke Agent (Payload + JWT)\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate A2A Policy (APP -&gt; Agent via JWT)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;A2A: Policy Permit\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT: Route to Target Agent\n    \n    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)\n    %% PHASE 1: Cognitive Phase (LLM makes the decision)\n    AGT-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Submit System/User Prompt + JWT\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate LLM Policy (Agent -&gt; Model)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Policy Permit\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;LLM: Execute Prompt\n    Note right of LLM: LLM decides tool is needed.&lt;br/&gt;Outputs JSON intent ONLY.&lt;br/&gt;(LLM makes zero network calls)\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Return JSON Tool Call Intent\n    LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT: Pass JSON payload back to Agent application\n    end\n    \n    rect rgb(255, 245, 238)\n    %% PHASE 2: Execution Phase (Agent makes the physical call)\n    Note over AGT,MCPGW: LLM is now disconnected.&lt;br/&gt;Agent code parses JSON and executes the API call.\n    AGT-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Invoke MCP Tool (JSON Args + JWT)\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate MCP Policy (Agent -&gt; Tool)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Policy Permit (Blocks hallucinated tools)\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCP: Execute Tool Function\n    \n    %% Backend Resource Access\n    MCP-&gt;&gt;RES: API Call + JWT\n    Note over MCP,RES: RES validates JWT signature &lt;br/&gt;&amp; scopes statelessly.\n    RES--&gt;&gt;MCP: Return Resource Data\n    MCP--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Return Tool Execution Result\n    MCPGW--&gt;&gt;AGT: Pass Raw Data back to Agent code\n    end\n    \n    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)\n    %% PHASE 3: Synthesis Phase (LLM formats the output)\n    AGT-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Submit Tool Result + Original Context + JWT\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;LLM: Execute Completion Prompt\n    Note right of LLM: LLM reads raw data and&lt;br/&gt;synthesizes human-readable text.\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Final Answer\n    LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT: Return Final Answer\n    end\n    \n    %% Return to User\n    AGT--&gt;&gt;A2A: Agent Execution Complete\n    A2A--&gt;&gt;APP: Return Orchestrated Result\n    APP--&gt;&gt;U: Final Response&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="iOLB6PaXiYONk9cJiHz8-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="iOLB6PaXiYONk9cJiHz8-85" parent="iOLB6PaXiYONk9cJiHz8-1" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#f0f8ff;fillOpacity=100;pointerEvents=0;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="479" width="1338" x="1108" y="643" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
