  <diagram id="mkxdM0KKUhz2x-f8Rwcr" name="Autonomous">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3113" dy="1728" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor U as User\n    participant SSO as fmSSO (iDP)\n    participant APP as ai-app (Orchestrator)\n    participant A2A as A2AGW\n    participant AGT as Agent\n    participant LLMGW as LLMGW\n    participant LLM as Backend LLM\n    participant MCPGW as MCPGW\n    participant MCP as MCP-Server-Tools\n    participant eAOR as eAOR (Registry/Policy)\n    participant RES as Backend Resource\n    \n    %% Authentication &amp; Edge Interaction\n    U-&gt;&gt;SSO: Authenticate\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;U: Return OpaqueToken\n    U-&gt;&gt;APP: Submit High-Level Goal + OpaqueToken\n    \n    %% Token Pivot for Long-Running Autonomous Task\n    APP-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange (OpaqueToken -&gt; Workload JWT)\n    Note over APP,SSO: Pivot to Workload Identity JWT.&lt;br/&gt;Binds User Context for long-running execution.\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;APP: Return Autonomous JWT\n    \n    %% Agent Invocation &amp; Discovery\n    APP-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Fetch Agent Routing Policy\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;APP: Return Agent Route\n    APP-&gt;&gt;A2A: Invoke Autonomous Agent (Goal + JWT)\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT: Route Request\n    \n    %% Dynamic Capability Discovery\n    AGT-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Fetch Permitted Tool Schemas via JWT\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;AGT: Return OpenAPI/MCP JSON Schemas\n    Note over AGT,eAOR: Agent now knows what tools it can use&lt;br/&gt;without hardcoded routing.\n\n    loop Autonomous Execution (Until Goal Reached or Budget Exhausted)\n        \n        rect rgb(240, 248, 255)\n        %% PHASE 1: Cognitive Phase (Planning &amp; Decision)\n        AGT-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Submit Goal + Current State + Tool Schemas + JWT\n        LLMGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Check Circuit Breaker (Budget/Loop Limits)\n        eAOR--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Policy Permit (Proceed)\n        LLMGW-&gt;&gt;LLM: Execute Prompt\n        Note right of LLM: LLM analyzes current state.&lt;br/&gt;Outputs JSON for NEXT tool,&lt;br/&gt;or outputs FINAL answer.\n        LLM--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Return JSON (Tool Intent OR Final Result)\n        LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT: Pass JSON payload\n        end\n        \n        %% Loop Break Condition\n        alt If JSON == FINAL RESULT\n            Note over AGT: Agent detects goal is achieved.&lt;br/&gt;Breaks autonomous loop.\n        else If JSON == TOOL INTENT\n            \n            rect rgb(255, 245, 238)\n            %% PHASE 2: Execution Phase\n            Note over AGT,MCPGW: Agent parses JSON and executes&lt;br/&gt;the API call statelessly.\n            AGT-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Invoke MCP Tool (JSON Args + JWT)\n            MCPGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate MCP Policy (Agent -&gt; Tool)\n            eAOR--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Policy Permit (Blocks hallucinated tools)\n            MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCP: Execute Tool Function\n            \n            %% Backend Resource Access\n            MCP-&gt;&gt;RES: API Call + JWT (User Context applied)\n            RES--&gt;&gt;MCP: Return Resource Data\n            MCP--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Return Tool Execution Result\n            MCPGW--&gt;&gt;AGT: Pass Raw Data back to Agent\n            Note over AGT: Agent appends tool result to state memory&lt;br/&gt;and restarts loop.\n            end\n        end\n    end\n    \n    %% Return to User\n    AGT--&gt;&gt;A2A: Autonomous Execution Complete\n    A2A--&gt;&gt;APP: Return Final Orchestrated Result\n    APP--&gt;&gt;U: Final Response&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="YDXlppiQ0BTeOzI5rnWY-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="YDXlppiQ0BTeOzI5rnWY-2" parent="YDXlppiQ0BTeOzI5rnWY-1" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#f0f8ff;fillOpacity=100;pointerEvents=0;fontColor=light-dark(#333333,#cccccc);fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="607" width="1455" x="1306" y="643" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
