  <diagram id="4hNuBy4eNILE1qzGCTRr" name="Page-7">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2490" dy="1382" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor U as User\n    participant SSO as fmSSO (iDP)\n    participant EDGE as Edge Ingress API\n    participant A2A as A2AGW\n    participant AGT_A as Agent A (Primary)\n    participant AGT_B as Agent B (Specialist)\n    participant LLMGW as LLMGW\n    participant LLM as Backend LLM\n    participant MCPGW as MCPGW\n    participant eAOR as eAOR (Registry/Policy)\n\n    %% Edge Authentication\n    U-&gt;&gt;SSO: Authenticate\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;U: Return OpaqueToken\n    U-&gt;&gt;EDGE: Submit Task + OpaqueToken\n    \n    %% Edge Token Exchange (Replaces Orchestrator)\n    EDGE-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange (OpaqueToken -&gt; JWT)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;EDGE: Return JWT\n    EDGE-&gt;&gt;A2A: Invoke Agent A (Payload + JWT)\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate Policy (Edge -&gt; Agent A)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;A2A: Policy Permit\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT_A: Route to Agent A\n\n    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)\n    %% Agent A Cognitive Phase (Decides to delegate)\n    AGT_A-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Submit Prompt + JWT\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate LLM Policy (Agent A -&gt; Model)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Permit\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;LLM: Execute Prompt\n    Note right of LLM: LLM determines a specialist&lt;br/&gt;Agent is needed. Outputs JSON intent&lt;br/&gt;to delegate to Agent B.\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Return JSON (Call Agent B)\n    LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT_A: Pass JSON payload\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)\n    %% Peer-to-Peer Agent Invocation (Decentralized Choreography)\n    Note over AGT_A,A2A: Agent A independently decides to invoke Agent B.&lt;br/&gt;No central Orchestrator involved.\n    AGT_A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Discover Agent Capabilities (Who can do this?)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;AGT_A: Return Agent B Metadata &amp; Schema\n    \n    AGT_A-&gt;&gt;A2A: Invoke Agent B (Sub-Task + JWT)\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate A2A Policy (Can Agent A call Agent B?)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;A2A: Policy Permit\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT_B: Route to Agent B\n    end\n\n    %% Agent B Autonomous Execution\n    AGT_B-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Process Sub-Task + JWT\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;LLM: Execute Prompt\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Return Tool Intent\n    LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT_B: Pass Intent\n    \n    AGT_B-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Invoke MCP Tool\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate Policy (Agent B -&gt; Tool)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Permit\n    Note over MCPGW: [Resource Access via JWT]\n    MCPGW--&gt;&gt;AGT_B: Tool Data\n\n    %% Bubble up results through the decentralized chain\n    AGT_B--&gt;&gt;A2A: Return Sub-Task Result\n    A2A--&gt;&gt;AGT_A: Pass Result to Agent A\n    \n    AGT_A-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Synthesize Agent B&#39;s Result + JWT\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;LLM: Execute Synthesis Prompt\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Final Human-Readable Answer\n    LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT_A: Final Answer\n    \n    AGT_A--&gt;&gt;EDGE: Execution Complete\n    EDGE--&gt;&gt;U: Final Response&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="a6GAzf9N8aPxv4yda98K-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
