  <diagram id="jeiQdbztWS4u0WS9hQRo" name="Page-8">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2490" dy="1382" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor U as User\n    participant UI as ChatBot Frontend (Browser)\n    participant BFF as WebApp Backend (BFF)\n    participant SSO as fmSSO (iDP)\n    participant A2A as A2AGW\n    participant AGT_A as Primary Agent\n    participant AGT_B as Specialist Agent\n    participant eAOR as eAOR (Registry/Policy)\n\n    %% 1. User Interaction\n    U-&gt;&gt;UI: Type Prompt: \&quot;Analyze the Q3 security logs\&quot;\n    UI-&gt;&gt;BFF: POST /api/chat (Prompt + OpaqueToken/SecureCookie)\n    \n    %% 2. WebApp acts as the Secure Edge\n    Note over BFF,SSO: The WebApp Backend terminates the user session&lt;br/&gt;and executes the OAuth 2.0 Token Exchange.\n    BFF-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange (OpaqueToken -&gt; JWT)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;BFF: Return JWT (User + App Identity)\n    \n    %% 3. Handoff to the Agent Network\n    BFF-&gt;&gt;A2A: Forward (Prompt + JWT) to Primary Agent\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate Policy (WebApp -&gt; Agent A)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;A2A: Policy Permit\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT_A: Invoke Primary Agent\n\n    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)\n    %% 4. Pure Agent-to-Agent Choreography\n    Note over AGT_A,AGT_B: The WebApp is now just waiting on a stream.&lt;br/&gt;Agent A takes over orchestration dynamically.\n    AGT_A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Discover Specialist Agent\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;AGT_A: Return Agent B Schema &amp; Metadata\n    \n    AGT_A-&gt;&gt;A2A: Delegate Sub-Task + JWT\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate A2A Policy (Agent A -&gt; Agent B)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;A2A: Policy Permit\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT_B: Invoke Specialist Agent\n    \n    %% Agent B executes its own LLM/MCP loops here (omitted for brevity)\n    AGT_B--&gt;&gt;A2A: Return Sub-Task Result\n    A2A--&gt;&gt;AGT_A: Pass Result to Primary Agent\n    end\n    \n    %% 5. Return to the User\n    Note over AGT_A, UI: Primary Agent synthesizes the final answer&lt;br/&gt;and streams it back through the open connection.\n    AGT_A--&gt;&gt;BFF: Stream Final Answer (SSE or WebSocket)\n    BFF--&gt;&gt;UI: Stream Output to Chat UI&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="U9iVIsUs6WW7WXtXWo5u-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
