        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor U as User\n    participant UI as WebApp / ChatBot (BFF)\n    participant SSO as fmSSO (iDP)\n    participant A2A as A2AGW\n    participant AGT1 as Agent 1 (Primary)\n    participant LLMGW as LLMGW\n    participant LLM as Backend LLM\n    participant MCPGW as MCPGW\n    participant MCP1 as MCP Tool 1 (e.g., DB Read)\n    participant MCP2 as MCP Tool 2 (e.g., API Action)\n    participant AGT2 as Agent 2 (Specialist)\n    participant eAOR as eAOR (Registry/Policy)\n    participant RES as Backend Resources\n\n    %% 1. Edge Interaction &amp; Token Exchange\n    U-&gt;&gt;UI: Submit Prompt + OpaqueToken\n    Note over UI,SSO: WebApp terminates session &amp; executes&lt;br/&gt;OAuth 2.0 Token Exchange (Opaque -&gt; JWT)\n    UI-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;UI: Return Rich JWT (User + App Identity)\n    UI-&gt;&gt;A2A: Invoke Agent 1 (Prompt + JWT)\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate A2A Policy (WebApp -&gt; Agent 1)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;A2A: Policy Permit\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT1: Route to Agent 1\n\n    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)\n    %% 2. Cognitive Phase 1 (Planning)\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Submit Prompt + JWT\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate LLM Policy (Agent 1 -&gt; Model)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Policy Permit\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;LLM: Execute Prompt\n    Note right of LLM: LLM determines execution plan:&lt;br/&gt;1. Run Tool 1&lt;br/&gt;2. Run Tool 2&lt;br/&gt;3. Delegate analysis to Agent 2\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Return Tool/Agent Execution Intent (JSON)\n    LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Pass JSON Plan to Agent 1 Code\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(255, 245, 238)\n    %% 3. Execution Phase: MCP Tool 1 (First Backend Resource)\n    Note over AGT1,MCPGW: Agent 1 executes first MCP Tool statelessly\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Invoke MCP Tool 1 (JSON Args + JWT)\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate MCP Policy (Agent 1 -&gt; Tool 1)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Policy Permit\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCP1: Execute Tool 1 Function\n    MCP1-&gt;&gt;RES: Read API Call + JWT\n    RES--&gt;&gt;MCP1: Return Dataset 1\n    MCP1--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Return Result 1\n    MCPGW--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Pass Result 1 back to Agent 1\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(255, 245, 238)\n    %% 4. Execution Phase: MCP Tool 2 (Second Backend Resource)\n    Note over AGT1,MCPGW: Agent 1 executes second distinct MCP Tool\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Invoke MCP Tool 2 (JSON Args + JWT)\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate MCP Policy (Agent 1 -&gt; Tool 2)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Policy Permit\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCP2: Execute Tool 2 Function\n    MCP2-&gt;&gt;RES: Action API Call + JWT\n    RES--&gt;&gt;MCP2: Return Execution Confirmation\n    MCP2--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Return Result 2\n    MCPGW--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Pass Result 2 back to Agent 1\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)\n    %% 5. Agent-to-Agent Choreography (Delegating to Agent 2)\n    Note over AGT1,AGT2: Agent 1 delegates specialist analysis to Agent 2\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Discover Agent 2 Capability &amp; Schema\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Return Agent 2 Metadata\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;A2A: Invoke Agent 2 (Dataset 1 + Result 2 + JWT)\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate A2A Policy (Agent 1 -&gt; Agent 2)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;A2A: Policy Permit\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT2: Route to Agent 2\n    Note over AGT2: Agent 2 runs its own LLM/Tool loops&lt;br/&gt;under down-scoped JWT permissions\n    AGT2--&gt;&gt;A2A: Return Specialist Analysis\n    A2A--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Pass Analysis to Agent 1\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)\n    %% 6. Final Synthesis Phase\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Submit All Results (Tool 1 + Tool 2 + Agent 2 Analysis) + JWT\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;LLM: Execute Synthesis Prompt\n    Note right of LLM: LLM combines all tool outputs and&lt;br/&gt;Agent 2&#39;s insights into a coherent answer\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Final Answer\n    LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Return Final Answer\n    end\n\n    %% 7. Return to User\n    AGT1--&gt;&gt;UI: Stream Output (SSE / WebSocket)\n    UI--&gt;&gt;U: Display Response in Chat UI&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="pfgOal0m-_NgrFOlu9bv-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
