  <diagram id="CWBAyg-pj-UeD2Ik8OGX" name="Page-10">
    <mxGraphModel dx="3113" dy="1728" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor U as User (sub: user_991)\n    participant UI as WebApp / ChatBot (BFF)\n    participant SSO as fmSSO (iDP)\n    participant A2A as A2AGW\n    participant AGT1 as Agent 1 (Primary)\n    participant LLMGW as LLMGW\n    participant LLM as Backend LLM\n    participant MCPGW as MCPGW\n    participant MCP1 as MCP Tool 1 (DB Read)\n    participant MCP2 as MCP Tool 2 (API Action)\n    participant AGT2 as Agent 2 (Specialist)\n    participant eAOR as eAOR (Registry/Policy)\n\n    %% 1. Edge Interaction &amp; Initial Token Exchange\n    U-&gt;&gt;UI: Submit Prompt + [T00: Opaque Token]\n    Note over UI,SSO: WebApp terminates T00 &amp; trades for&lt;br/&gt;T01 (User Identity + WebApp Actor)\n    UI-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange (subject=T00, actor=webapp_id)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;UI: Return [T01: Initial JWT]\n    \n    %% 2. Invoke Primary Agent\n    UI-&gt;&gt;A2A: Invoke Agent 1 + [T01]\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate Policy (WebApp -&gt; Agent 1)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;A2A: Policy Permit\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT1: Route to Agent 1 + [T01]\n\n    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)\n    %% 3. Cognitive Phase (LLM Gateway Exchange)\n    Note over AGT1,SSO: Agent 1 exchanges T01 for T02&lt;br/&gt;down-scoped strictly for LLM access\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange (subject=T01, aud=model-gateway)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Return [T02: LLM JWT]\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Submit Prompt + [T02]\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate Policy (Agent 1 -&gt; Model)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Permit\n    LLMGW-&gt;&gt;LLM: Execute Prompt\n    LLM--&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Return Tool/Agent Plan (JSON)\n    LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Pass JSON Plan\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(255, 245, 238)\n    %% 4. Execution: MCP Tool 1\n    Note over AGT1,SSO: Agent 1 exchanges T01 for T03&lt;br/&gt;down-scoped for Tool 1 (DB Read)\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange (subject=T01, aud=mcp-db-tool)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Return [T03: MCP1 JWT]\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Invoke MCP Tool 1 + [T03]\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate Policy (Agent 1 -&gt; Tool 1)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Permit\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCP1: Execute Tool 1 Function + [T03]\n    MCP1--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Return DB Dataset\n    MCPGW--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Pass Dataset\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(255, 245, 238)\n    %% 5. Execution: MCP Tool 2\n    Note over AGT1,SSO: Agent 1 exchanges T01 for T04&lt;br/&gt;down-scoped for Tool 2 (Action API)\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange (subject=T01, aud=mcp-action-tool)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Return [T04: MCP2 JWT]\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Invoke MCP Tool 2 + [T04]\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate Policy (Agent 1 -&gt; Tool 2)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Permit\n    MCPGW-&gt;&gt;MCP2: Execute Tool 2 Function + [T04]\n    MCP2--&gt;&gt;MCPGW: Return Action Confirmation\n    MCPGW--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Pass Confirmation\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)\n    %% 6. Agent-to-Agent Delegation (Agent 2)\n    Note over AGT1,SSO: Agent 1 exchanges T01 for T05&lt;br/&gt;delegating user identity to Agent 2\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;SSO: Token Exchange (subject=T01, aud=agent-specialist)\n    SSO--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Return [T05: A2A JWT]\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;A2A: Delegate to Agent 2 + [T05]\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;eAOR: Validate Policy (Agent 1 -&gt; Agent 2)\n    eAOR--&gt;&gt;A2A: Permit\n    A2A-&gt;&gt;AGT2: Route to Agent 2 + [T05]\n    Note over AGT2: Agent 2 performs its own internal&lt;br/&gt;LLM/Tool exchanges using T05 as subject\n    AGT2--&gt;&gt;A2A: Return Specialist Analysis\n    A2A--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Pass Analysis\n    end\n\n    %% 7. Final Synthesis &amp; Return\n    AGT1-&gt;&gt;LLMGW: Submit All Results + [T02]\n    LLMGW--&gt;&gt;AGT1: Return Final Answer\n    AGT1--&gt;&gt;UI: Stream Output\n    UI--&gt;&gt;U: Display Response&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="KOXy3jWSUVdIPou8t_lA-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
